|content1=
* October 10th - '''Zero Tenacity''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' with a roster consisting of [[peanutworld]], [[simke]], [[brutmonster]], [[Cjoffo]], [[nEMANHA]] and [[UNTOUCHED]], with the latter joining as coach. <ref name="Z10 CSGO">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/CU24jB6M3M0/|title=Konačno, zadovoljstvo nam je da vam predstavimo naš CS:GO sastav!|language={{Flag|rs}} Serbian|trans_title=Finally, we are pleased to present our CS:GO lineup!|date=2021-10-10|author='''Zero Tenacity'''}}</ref>

|content2=
* August 23rd - '''Zero Tenacity''' part ways with [[UNTOUCHED]] and sign [[aVN]] and [[fajkus]], with the latter joining as coach. <ref name="+aVN +fajkus">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/Chm1AqCravi/|title=Do sada su jurili za slavom, ali vreme je da se uozbilje uz @zero_tenacity!|language={{Flag|rs}} Serbian|trans_title=Up untill now they were chasing for Glory, but now it's time to get serious with @zero_tenacity!|date=2022-08-23|author='''Zero Tenacity'''}}</ref>
* August 29th - '''Zero Tenacity''' part ways with [[peanutworld]]. <ref name="-peanutworld">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/Ch2IX04jgpG/|title=Danas se opraštamo od @mario.jonjic|language={{Flag|rs}} Serbian|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to @mario.jonjic|date=2022-08-29|author='''Zero Tenacity'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* May 29th - '''Zero Tenacity''' sign [[dr4ski]] as an analyst. <ref name="+dr4ski">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Z10esports/status/1663216766124716035|title=Please welcome the latest addition to our cs:go team|date=2023-05-29|author='''Zero Tenacity'''}}</ref>
* September 14th - '''Zero Tenacity''' sign [[kdaN]] as a substitute. <ref name="+kdaN">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Z10esports/status/1702311376033583537|title=Some new steps, some new faces!|date=2023-09-14|author='''Zero Tenacity'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* October 24th - '''Zero Tenacity''' part ways with [[kdaN]]. <ref name="-kdaN">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Krkic_Cs/status/1849435868689273228|title=Free Agent|date=2024-10-24|author=[[kdaN]]}}</ref>

|content5=
* May 30th - '''Zero Tenacity''' bench [[simke]] and sign [[maden]]. <ref name="simke bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Z10esports/status/1928413626974478618|title=Been a long ride since 2021|date=2025-05-30|author='''Zero Tenacity'''}}</ref><ref name="+maden">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/z10esports/status/1928424923652890802|title=GUESS WHAT?|date=2025-05-30|author='''Zero Tenacity'''}}</ref>
* November 11th - '''Zero Tenacity''' part ways with [[maden]]. <ref name="-maden">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/madennCS/status/1988173102459785324|title=Hey guys,I have been playing few months with @Z10esports and it was nice playing and meeting all of them!|date=2025-11-11|author=[[maden]]}}</ref>
* December 2nd - '''Zero Tenacity''' release their ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' division. <ref name="-cs 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/hebibrows/status/1995901692705972335|title=Part of my journey in esports is also to hit the breaks, pause and recollect|date=2025-12-02|author=[[Dimitrije Malesevic]]}}</ref>
}}

